# Dev QA report template

Write one `### Round <n>` subsection per round under `## Dev QA report` in the brief; never edit an
earlier round. Bring `## Hand-off to the QA team` up to the latest state every round: keep the
follow-ups earlier steps added there and the lines Ship added, and add any follow-up
`## Implementation` lists that is missing. Keep evidence concrete: test names, commands, numbers,
`path:line`. Leave out no box: write "none" when a list is empty, so the reader knows it was checked.

